       40 |         25 |     750 |      27
       50 |         35 |    1400 |      37
       60 |         45 |    2250 |      47
(4 rows)

/* <<pgx-lower-config>>: auto_should_route_to=lower id=pgx_30_test_missing_expressions_028 */
